                                                "example_id": "89cc5b11-c3df-490b-8dc5-8c5f61e40c89",
                                                "sense_id": "640f672d-2d44-3a0c-a976-5bb5773de77a",
                                                "text": "I have known some happy spirits, who could sit for hours, when no other amusement presented, and talk of the winkings and squintings, they had lately been so eagle-eyed, as to detect between some innocent couple […]"
